window.products.push({"id":142114,"name":"Northair Portable Ice Maker - 26 lbs Daily Capacity - Self Cleaning - Includes Ice Scoop and Basket - Small and Large Bullet Shaped Ice - Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613-nFkS79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEAR INSTANT ICE - Produce 9 freshly made bullet-shaped ice cubes inside of 6 minutes. Fill the 2.2 litre water reservoir with water, hit go, and enjoy perfectly formed ice in minutes. Perfect for hot summer days and parties with friends. Produces 26 lbs of ice on a continuous run. ACCESSIBLE - Unlike other Ice Makers, we designed the Northair Portable Ice Maker to deliver large volumes of ice whilst taking up the least amount of space. Measuring in at 13.9”(L) x 9.5”(W) x 13.0”(H), this ice machine fits on even the smallest kitchen work surface. SMART FEATURES - The large viewing window allows you to quickly check the indicator lights to see when the basket is ready and full of ice, or whether you need to top up the system with more water. Features simple to use self cleaning function with a long-press of the ON button. PORTABLE - Compared to other ice makers, the Northair Countertop Ice Maker does not require a direct mainline to nearby water. Place it anywhere inside of your modern home, or take it with you to get togethers with your friends and family for refreshing iced drinks for everybody. BULLET-SHAPED ICE - Produces both small and large size bullet ice cubes (Small: 0.8” x 1.0” - Large: 1.0” x 1.2”). Once ready, the ice falls into the provided ice bucket and is ready to be served. Use the provided ice scoop to dish out and serve the ice for drinks, cooling, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613-nFkS79L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Northair","source_asin":"B08QHV229B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-142114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QHV229B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QHV229B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
