window.products.push({"id":142466,"name":"Ice Makers Countertop, Self-Cleaning Function, Portable Electric Ice Cube Maker Machine, 9 Pebble Ice Ready in 6 Mins, 26lbs 24Hrs with Ice Bags and I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgQB091RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【New Self Cleaning Ice Maker】 Our portable ice maker machine features self-cleaning function, press the ON/OFF button for 5 seconds to activate the automatic cleaning mode, making the cleaning progress much easier. This countertop ice maker provides 5 pcs ice bags, a ice scoop and a removable ice basket in the package, it also comes with a hook to hang the ice scoop, helping you transfer and store the fresh ice cubes to the fridge easily in a clean, safe and healthy condition! 【Quiet & Efficient Ice Machine】 This ice maker machine for countertop equipped with the most advanced compressor to make it highly efficient and stable in ice making process. With the quiet cooling fan, the rv portable ice makers countertop prime clearance can does not make too much noise during ice-making, allows you to enjoy clear ice cubes and cool drinks in a quiet environment. 【2 Sizes of Ice Cube Selectable】 Our counter top ice maker machine provide you the best quality ice cubes. Perfect for when the weather is hot, when you’re craving a cold drink, when you need to keep food fresh, or when you just want to cool off your forehead – we’ve got you covered. It has small or large size of bullet-shaped ice cubes to choose, to meet all your different needs. 【Touch Sensitive Control】 This ice makers countertop has the most advanced infrared sensor technology. When the ice basket is full, the electric ice maker will stop ice making to prevent ice from overflowing. You can see the ice making process through the transparent window. When the water level in the water tank is insufficient, the ice maker indicator also reminds you to replenish water in time. 【Portable & Compact Ice Maker】 The lightweight and portable design of the countertop ice cube maker is easy to store or carry. This tabletop ice maker machine countertop is equipped with a removable ice basket and ice scoop, so you can move pellet ice cubes easily. You can place the mini portable ice maker countertop top rated prime anywhere, perfect for kitchen, office, bar, camping, RV, or parties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PgQB091RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FZF","source_asin":"B0B3SRMSJY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-142466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3SRMSJY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3SRMSJY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
