window.products.push({"id":142491,"name":"Portable Washing Machine Koswin Full-Automatic Portable Washer with 8 lbs Load Capacity 6 Washing Programs Up Drainage 1.0 Cu.ft Top Load LED Display ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DQKLJJqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable and Full-automatic】This washing machine with compact and lightweight design is ideal for space saving in your dormitory and apartment. The full-automatic spin wash and dry makes it easy to operate from 6 washing program options. With improved load capacity up to 8 lbs, it can meet all your daily laundry needs with durable performance. 【Strong and Powerful but QUIET】Stainless steel interior tub with powerful motor was designed for durable use in this washing machine. To seek perfection, Koswin enhances your experience with noise cancellation design. 30db ~ 50db of low level keeps you far away from noise. You can stay comfortable and enjoy reading, music and movie while washing. 【Looks Great】Premium metallic design with painting decoration gives a sleek and elegant look to this portable washer. Through the soft closing cover with transparent tempered glass, you can get a clear view of washing process. Now doing laundry with Koswin washer becomes interesting and enjoyable. 【Safe and Environmentally Friendly】For your daily use, Koswin considered the safety in high priority during the design and production, strictly complying with US safety request and currently holds the official certificate. All the raw materials and components we used to design and build this washer are environmentally friendly complying with ROHS request without hazardous substances. Be confident that this washer is quite safe to you and the environment you live in. 【12-month Warranty】We respect every cent you spend for our product. What we can do is control the quality well and deliver the qualified washer to you avoiding any inconvenience caused by quality issue. In addition to that, we offer you 12 months warranty after your purchase and this will be beneficial to you. For any questions, feel free to contact our service team by email or hot line. We are always happy to get close with you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DQKLJJqOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koswin","source_asin":"B08DL159Z8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-142491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DL159Z8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DL159Z8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
