window.products.push({"id":142568,"name":"WP3-60336-001 Evaporator Fan Motor Whirlpool 3-60336-001 AP6007509 PS11740626 EVL209NBTQ00 MQU1556AEW MQF1656TEW00 EV201NXMQ05 MQF1656TEW00 EVL201NXRQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fU3PSm4AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Wp3-60336-001 Fan Motor - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP6007509, 4390914, 68001613, PS11740626, 3-60336-001. Refrigerator evaporator motor is compatible with Whirlpool, Amana, Crosley, Maytag appliances. WP3-60336-001 3-60336-001 Evaporator Fan Motor is a type of motor that is commonly used in refrigeration and cooling systems. This motor is designed to drive the fan blade of an evaporator, which is responsible for circulating cool air throughout the system. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. WP3-60336-001 3-60336-001 Refrigerator Motor Evap will help if your appliance is noisy and too warm. Our part will convert the heat into cold air, which is then being circulated. It fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 💡 WP3-60336-001 Evaporator Fan Motor is a high-quality motor that is designed to be reliable and durable, and it is built to last for many years of continuous operation. Wp3-60336-001 Refrigerator Evaporator Fan Motor meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 The WP3-60336-001 3-60336-001 Evaporator Fan Motor is easy to install and requires minimal maintenance. It is designed to be a direct replacement for many other evaporator fan motors, making it a convenient choice for retrofitting or upgrading existing refrigeration systems. The 3-60336-001 Motor is also designed to be quiet and efficient, which helps to reduce noise and energy consumption in the refrigeration system. 💡 Is it possible to bypass the evaporator fan motor? Bypassing an Evaporator Fan Motor is not recommended as it can lead to serious issues with the refrigeration system. The fan motor plays a critical role in circulating air over the evaporator coil, which is responsible for removing heat from the refrigerant and cooling the system. Without proper air circulation, the evaporator coil can freeze up, which can cause the compressor to fail, leading to costly repairs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fU3PSm4AS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B08LVT82SM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-142568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LVT82SM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LVT82SM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
