window.products.push({"id":142901,"name":"DCS Deals Aluminum Foil Round Gas Stove Burner Covers – Pack of 50 – Disposable Bib Liners for Kitchen Gas Range Top - Keep Your Gas Range Clean Drip ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXBNVzgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅ NO MORE SCRUBBING YOUR STOVETOP – Have you ever accidentally let your pot boil over and spill onto your stove? Or perhaps you hate all those greasy drips and splashes when frying food? These innovative aluminum burner covers will keep your stove clean without the need to scrub off those pieces of stuck on food every time you cook! ✅ FITS ONTO MOST GAS RANGES – The 8.5\" x 8.5\" Foil Bib and the 3.66-inch hole should fit over most gas burners. If the hole seems too small for larger gas ranges, simply take a pair of scissors and cut the hole bigger to fit over your gas. These gas top covers are made to withstand the extremely high temperatures of your gas range stovetop. ✅ AVOID HARSH SPRAY CLEANERS – Even if you don’t use them often, harsh chemicals can be dangerous for your health. These heavy-duty foil gas covers will save you breathing in or touching any toxic chemicals. If you think your foil gas drip pan is too dirty, simply throw it out and replace with a new one. ✅ ADD A SLEEK AND MODERN TOUCH TO YOUR KITCHEN – Not only will these bib liners protect your stovetop from dirt, spills, sticky sauce and wear and tear, they will also create a nice modern look in your kitchen. The polished silver oven top liner will certainly upgrade your kitchen, without costing a ton of money. ✅ 100% RECYCLABLE, ODORLESS AND APPROVED – This foil burner drip pans are made with top grade heavy duty foil. These heavy duty durable stovetop protectors are nontoxic, 100% recyclable, odorless and approved. The round burner pan comes in a pack of 50 which will last for many weeks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vXBNVzgSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DCS Deals","source_asin":"B07V9X5FQB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-142901","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V9X5FQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V9X5FQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
