window.products.push({"id":142963,"name":"Dryer Anti Vibration Pads, Washing Machine Feet, PU Non Slip Shock and Noise Cancelling Mat for Washer and Dryer Machine Support Protects Pedestals 4 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SWaR5ANzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Need to stop your washer from walking across the floor? Want to quiet the noise and vibrations your washer sends throughout your home? Strong self-adhesive PU pads solve your vibrating appliance problems! Stops Walking & Skidding by Anchoring Appliances - Our Strong self-adhesive PU pads anchors your vibrating appliance, preventing it from moving around. This unique design puts up to 60% more pad surface area in direct contact with your floor, providing superior traction Restores Quiet by Minimizing Vibration & Noise from Washing Machines & Other Appliances - Our durable, heavy-duty material, engineered for outstanding sound and vibration isolation, dampens vibrations and noise transferred from appliances to your floor and the rest of your home Protects Floors & Appliances - Absorbs impacts from vibrating appliances to protect floors and the appliance itself from damage. Universal Fit -Compatible with front or top load washer, dryer, 2-in-1, or other appliance from any brand. Works with any side by side, stacked, or standalone appliance with or without pedestals, with feet up to 1.57inch in diameter Quick & Easy DIY Install in Minutes Without Tools - Simply tilt your appliance to one side, slide a VibraShield pad under each lifted foot, lower your appliance's feet onto the pads, then repeat for the other side. Installs quickly in a few easy steps without tools or professional installation. Before installing, ensure your appliance is level Non-stink Material - Our material does not emit the strong lingering odors that buyers of other similar pads complain about","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SWaR5ANzL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEYOSING","source_asin":"B097NLXW3N","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-142963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NLXW3N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NLXW3N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
