window.products.push({"id":142975,"name":"154174501 Dishwasher Wheels Frigidaire 5300809640 Wheel Lower Rack Durable Replacement 4-Pack - Replaces 5304532229, AP7195062, 5304521179, 154174503,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vU5TZoreS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 5300809640 154174501 Dishwasher Wheels Lower Rack - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP2135554, 154174502, 154294801, 3202777, 612977, AH452448, EA452448, PS452448. Lower dishrack wheel assembly is compatible with Frigidaire, Crosley, Gibson, Kelvinator, Kenmore, Tappan, Uni, Westinghouse. It connects to the dishrack and allows you to roll the dishrack in and out. 154174501 Dishwasher Wheels fit dozens of models and can be easily installed; no special tools required. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. 154174501 5300809640 Dishwasher Wheels will help if your appliance does not clean dishes properly. Replacing the dishwasher rack wheels can help to restore the smooth operation of the dishwasher racks, making it easier to load and unload dishes. 💡 The 154174501 Dishwasher Rack Wheels are made of high-quality plastic and are designed to withstand the high temperatures and pressure that are common in dishwasher cycles. They are easy to install and can be attached to the bottom of the dishwasher rack, allowing the rack to roll smoothly in and out of the dishwasher. Frigidaire 5300809640 Dishwasher Rack Wheels meet or exceed all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are the dishwasher wheels universal? Dishwasher rack wheels are not universal and are designed to fit specific makes and models of dishwashers. It is important to ensure that you purchase the correct replacement wheels for your dishwasher to ensure a proper fit and avoid potential damage to the dishwasher rack or other parts. While some dishwasher rack wheels may look similar, they may have slight differences in size or shape that make them incompatible with certain models. 💡 Can the dishwasher wheels be bypassed? It is not recommended to bypass or remove the dishwasher wheels as they serve an important function in allowing the dishwasher racks to slide smoothly in and out of the machine. Removing or bypassing the wheels could cause damage to the dishwasher rack or other parts of the machine, and may also affect the efficiency of the dishwasher's cleaning and drying process.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vU5TZoreS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07YD89NNS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-142975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD89NNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YD89NNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
